---
import StorefrontLayout from '../layouts/Storefront.astro';
---

<StorefrontLayout
  title="About Us | Symeno"
  description="How we source authentic hardware and bypass traditional retail markups."
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-base">
    
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-outline py-24 md:py-32">
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-0 right-0 h-[500px] w-[500px] rounded-full bg-brand opacity-[0.03] blur-[100px]"></div>

      <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <span class="mb-6 block font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] text-brand uppercase">
          The Symeno Story
        </span>
        <h1 class="mb-8 text-4xl leading-tight font-bold tracking-tighter text-content md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
          Premium hardware shouldn't come with <span class="text-content-muted">premium retail markups.</span> 
        </h1>
        <div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed font-light text-content-muted">
          <p>
            Symeno was built by a group of supply chain operators and hardware enthusiasts who got tired of watching consumers foot the bill for inefficient retail models.
          </p>
          <p>
            The traditional commerce system is heavy. Every time a product moves from a manufacturer to a regional broker, and finally to a retail shelf, the price goes up. By the time you buy it, you are paying for their commercial real estate, aggressive marketing campaigns, and layered management.
          </p>
          <p class="font-medium text-content border-l-2 border-brand pl-4">
            We decided to build a direct path. We buy authentic, premium hardware in bulk from authorized distributors, keep our overhead low, and pass the true savings directly to you.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-24 md:py-32 border-b border-outline/50 bg-surface/20">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-16 md:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-24">
          <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
            <h2 class="mb-12 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-content">
              How we keep our prices low.
            </h2>

            <div class="relative space-y-12 border-l border-outline pl-8">
              <div class="relative">
                <span class="absolute top-1 -left-[37px] h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-brand shadow-[0_0_10px_var(--color-brand)]"></span>
                <span class="mb-2 block font-mono text-4xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-content">01</span>
                <h3 class="mb-3 text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-content uppercase">Volume Purchasing</h3>
                <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed font-light text-content-muted">
                  We don't buy items one by one. We pool our capital to make massive wholesale orders directly with authorized Tier-1 distributors. We get the volume discounts, and you get the lower price.  
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <span class="absolute top-1 -left-[37px] h-2 w-2 rounded-full border border-outline bg-surface"></span>
                <span class="mb-2 block font-mono text-4xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-content">02</span>
                <h3 class="mb-3 text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-content uppercase">No Retail Showrooms</h3>
                <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed font-light text-content-muted">
                  We don't have physical storefronts or commissioned salespeople. Our storefront is entirely digital, and our warehouse operations are heavily automated. Because our overhead is so low, we don't need to add a 40% markup just to keep the lights on.  
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <span class="absolute top-1 -left-[37px] h-2 w-2 rounded-full border border-outline bg-surface"></span>
                <span class="mb-2 block font-mono text-4xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-content">03</span>
                <h3 class="mb-3 text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-content uppercase">Flat Margins</h3>
                <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed font-light text-content-muted">
                  We take a small, sustainable cut on our wholesale cost to support our team and infrastructure. That is it. The rest of the discount stays exactly where it belongs: in your pocket.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
            <div class="border border-outline bg-surface p-8 shadow-[0_20px_40px_-15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] md:p-12">
              <h3 class="mb-8 text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-content">Company Facts</h3>

              <ul class="space-y-6 font-mono text-sm">
                <li class="flex justify-between border-b border-outline pb-4">
                  <span class="text-content-muted uppercase">Headquarters</span>
                  <span class="text-right text-content">SYMENO LLC<br /><span class="text-[10px] text-content-muted">Sheridan, Wyoming, USA</span></span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex justify-between border-b border-outline pb-4">
                  <span class="text-content-muted uppercase">Inventory</span>
                  <span class="text-right text-brand">100% Owned & Stocked<br /><span class="text-[10px] text-content-muted">(We never dropship)</span></span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex justify-between border-b border-outline pb-4">
                  <span class="text-content-muted uppercase">Payments</span>
                  <span class="text-right text-content">Secured by Stripe (PCI Level 1)</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex justify-between pb-2">
                  <span class="text-content-muted uppercase">Our Promise</span>
                  <span class="text-right text-content">30-Day Returns<br />100% Authentic Products</span>   
                </li>
              </ul>

              <div class="mt-12 border-t border-outline pt-8">
                <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-content-muted italic">
                  "We know buying premium tech online requires trust. We don't ask you to blindly trust our marketing—we ask you to look at our prices, our fast shipping, and our return policy. The service speaks for itself."
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-24 md:py-32 border-b border-outline/50">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="mb-16 text-center">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-content md:text-3xl">The Symeno Difference.</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm font-mono tracking-widest text-content-muted uppercase">How we compare to standard retail</p>
        </div>

        <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-outline bg-surface">
          <table class="w-full text-left text-sm">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b border-outline bg-base">
                <th class="p-5 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-widest text-content-muted uppercase">Business Area</th>
                <th class="p-5 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest text-brand uppercase border-l border-outline">Symeno</th>
                <th class="p-5 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-widest text-content-muted uppercase border-l border-outline">Standard Retail</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-outline">
              <tr>
                <td class="p-5 font-medium text-content">Infrastructure</td>
                <td class="p-5 text-content border-l border-outline">100% Online (No physical retail stores)</td>
                <td class="p-5 text-content-muted border-l border-outline">Expensive commercial leases & showrooms</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="bg-base/50">
                <td class="p-5 font-medium text-content">Inventory</td>
                <td class="p-5 text-content border-l border-outline">100% physically stocked in our hub</td>
                <td class="p-5 text-content-muted border-l border-outline">Often backordered or dropshipped</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="p-5 font-medium text-content">Pricing Model</td>
                <td class="p-5 text-content border-l border-outline">Wholesale cost + Flat margin</td>
                <td class="p-5 text-content-muted border-l border-outline">Layered markups (Up to 40% higher)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="bg-base/50">
                <td class="p-5 font-medium text-content">Sourcing</td>
                <td class="p-5 text-content border-l border-outline">Direct from Tier-1 Authorized Distributors</td>
                <td class="p-5 text-content-muted border-l border-outline">Complex, multi-layered broker networks</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-24 md:py-32 border-b border-outline/50 bg-surface/20">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          
          <div class="border border-outline bg-base p-8 rounded-md">
            <div class="mb-6 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand/10 text-brand">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-content">Secure Transactions</h3>
            <p class="mb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-content-muted">
              Buying expensive electronics online requires trust. We process all payments via Stripe and use industry-leading fraud prevention so you can shop safely.
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-3 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-wide text-content">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-brand"></span> 3D Secure 2.0 Authentication</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-brand"></span> End-to-End Encryption</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="border border-outline bg-base p-8 rounded-md">
            <div class="mb-6 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-outline text-content">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-content">B2B Procurement</h3>
            <p class="mb-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-content-muted">
              We frequently handle volume procurement for corporate offices, studios, and startups. If you need to equip a team, we can handle the logistics.
            </p>
            <a href="mailto:wholesale@symeno.com" class="inline-flex items-center text-xs font-bold text-brand hover:underline">
              Contact B2B Sales &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="border border-outline bg-base p-8 rounded-md">
            <div class="mb-6 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-surface text-content">
              <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-content">Reducing E-Waste</h3>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-content-muted">
              The electronics industry produces massive waste through unsold inventory. By sourcing overstock and redistributing it efficiently, our arbitrage model helps keep perfectly good, brand-new technology out of landfills.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-24 text-center">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4">
        <h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-content">Ready to shop?</h2>
        <p class="mb-10 text-sm text-content-muted">Browse our latest inventory. Stock updates in real-time.</p>
        <a href="/shop" class="inline-block bg-brand px-8 py-4 font-mono text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-brand-dark uppercase transition-opacity hover:opacity-90 rounded-sm">
          View Catalog
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</StorefrontLayout>